              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Christina Spakousky"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Delicious! I added some fresh thyme and zucchinni; sauted the vegetables in fresh garlic and evoo. Warm and comforting especially when it was all I had in the house. Thanks.",
